From: vkd3d-crossover <noreply@vkd3d-crossover.invalid>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 07/13] feat(dev): report per-queue activity from Present
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Dev only, not for release builds.

Problem: needed to see whether Requiem's streaming and other queues were
still submitting work during the black screen (N§29).

Root cause: n/a (diagnostic).

Fix: every queue is registered with the DLL that created it; every 10 s,
from Present, log per queue the submits, command lists, dispatches, copies
(count and MB), signals (with the last value) and waits. Counters are
updated even with diagnostics off; only the report is gated.

Verified by: Requiem: streaming had stopped and no DirectStorage queues were
present (N§29).

Off switch: needs VKD3D_DIAGNOSTICS=1; VKD3D_QUEUE_ACTIVITY_LOG=0 disables.
